---
description: Select useful actual native reference values for a requested adoption explanation.
args:
  goal: string
  evidence: AdoptionEvidence
returns: string[]
---
Choose only relevant observed reference values from the actual composition: source paths, pulled-in units, settings, owner, minimum app version or native issue. Return any useful subset, including none. Do not invent a reference for an unobserved role or copy an unrelated value merely to fill a count. The surrounding explanation can state the requested semantic conclusion in ordinary language.
